{"pages":[{"w":612.0,"h":792.0,"s":[[13.889,2.206,18.17,3.8,3.431,"EQUINOX"],[13.889,5.306,14.953,1.205,1.078,"Q U A N T I T A T I V E"],[69.444,2.807,15.359,1.643,1.471,"India Equity Research"],[69.444,4.27,11.266,1.46,1.307,"19 November 2026"],[13.889,10.995,35.794,3.651,3.268,"Hindustan Aeronautics"],[13.889,14.731,30.639,2.373,2.124,"Full order book, stalled cash flow"],[13.889,20.845,52.951,1.809,1.634,"HAL has fallen 6% since its Q2 FY27 results on 12 November (NIFTY: flat)."],[13.889,22.289,52.934,1.809,1.634,"Revenue rose 15% to ₹7,613 cr and profit to owners 16% to ₹1,936 cr, but less"],[13.889,23.733,52.954,1.809,1.634,"came from operations than the headline suggests. Operating EBITDA grew 12%"],[13.889,25.177,52.931,1.809,1.634,"and its margin slipped to 22.9% from 23.5%; joint-venture profit jumped to ₹97"],[13.889,26.621,52.954,1.809,1.634,"cr from ₹7 cr; and other income, mostly interest on ₹47,451 cr of cash, was 40%"],[13.889,28.065,52.931,1.809,1.634,"of H1 pre-tax profit. Inventories rose ₹8,653 cr in six months to ₹39,504 cr and"],[13.889,29.509,52.936,1.809,1.634,"operating cash flow fell to ₹1,573 cr from ₹7,377 cr. In May management put"],[13.889,30.954,46.671,1.809,1.634,"LCA Mk1A inventory at about ₹8,100 cr, held up by engines and trials."],[13.889,33.439,52.962,1.809,1.634,"1) We take H2 FY27E revenue up 10%, mid-guidance, at a 31.1% operating"],[13.889,34.883,52.931,1.809,1.634,"margin against 32.1% a year ago: aircraft earn less than overhaul work, and late"],[13.889,36.328,52.931,1.809,1.634,"ones carry liquidated-damages provisions. The guided 30% full-year margin"],[13.889,37.772,52.934,1.809,1.634,"needs 32.8% in H2. Our FY27E EPS of ₹145.92 is 3% below consensus. 2)"],[13.889,39.216,52.931,1.809,1.634,"FY28E-29E revenue grows 16% and 15% as LCA Mk1A, LCH and Su-30"],[13.889,40.684,52.951,1.809,1.634,"deliveries start against a ₹254,538 cr order book (7.7x FY26 revenue)."],[13.889,42.128,52.954,1.809,1.634,"Consensus has 22% for FY28E; we allow for past slippage. 3) EPS grows 14%"],[13.889,43.572,41.83,1.809,1.634,"and 13%; other income falls to 26% of pre-tax profit by FY29E."],[13.889,46.034,52.934,1.809,1.634,"Our Dec-27 target of ₹4,520 averages two methods. HAL’s own three-year"],[13.889,47.502,52.934,1.809,1.634,"average P/E of 31x on earnings twelve months ahead gives ₹5,648. A ten-year"],[13.889,48.946,52.951,1.809,1.634,"DCF of operating cash flow at 12%, plus ₹853 a share of cash, gives ₹3,400."],[13.889,50.39,52.954,1.809,1.634,"The gap is wide: at ₹4,675 the shares need operating free cash flow to grow 19%"],[13.889,51.834,52.931,1.809,1.634,"a year to FY37E; we forecast 11%. If customer advances grow with revenue, the"],[13.889,53.278,52.934,1.809,1.634,"DCF rises to ₹4,025 and the target to ₹4,840, still Neutral. What would prove us"],[13.889,54.722,52.964,1.809,1.634,"wrong: 20 LCA Mk1A deliveries a year and margins above 30%. Risk: fixed-"],[13.889,56.167,52.931,1.809,1.634,"price work since FY24 is booked at provisional prices pending the fourth"],[13.889,57.611,9.906,1.809,1.634,"pricing review."],[13.889,60.098,13.042,1.643,1.471,"Price Performance"],[14.451,68.709,2.306,1.022,0.915,"3,000"],[14.451,66.348,2.306,1.022,0.915,"4,000"],[14.451,63.998,2.306,1.022,0.915,"5,000"],[14.451,61.639,2.306,1.022,0.915,"6,000"],[18.061,69.404,2.796,1.022,0.915,"Jan 26"],[22.684,69.404,2.796,1.022,0.915,"Apr 26"],[27.471,69.404,2.47,1.022,0.915,"Jul 26"],[32.243,69.404,2.96,1.022,0.915,"Oct 26"],[19.112,70.575,2.295,1.275,1.111,"HAL ("],[21.41,70.601,0.618,1.241,1.111,"₹"],[22.023,70.575,0.303,1.275,1.111,")"],[25.107,70.575,7.901,1.275,1.111,"NIFTY 50 (rebased)"],[19.844,71.735,1.972,1.387,1.209,"YTD"],[25.535,71.735,1.433,1.387,1.209,"1m"],[30.675,71.735,1.433,1.387,1.209,"3m"],[34.446,71.735,1.984,1.387,1.209,"12m"],[15.277,72.8,1.691,1.387,1.209,"Abs"],[19.476,72.8,2.26,1.387,1.209,"7.6%"],[24.034,72.8,2.842,1.387,1.209,"−6.3%"],[29.174,72.8,2.842,1.387,1.209,"−8.3%"],[33.497,72.8,2.842